Z||000010||BBBAD GT||09-13-2000||10:14 PM||||The yellow Fiero is owned by a guy in Canada, I've talked to him before on IRC.  They are the Mustang Cobra R wheels (I'd kill for a set like them on my Fiero), and he had to pay big dollars to the machinest who made some sort of adaptors for the Mustang lug spacing.  They are <B>not</B> 5x100mm spacing.  He's got a V8 in there also.<P>------------------<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://scribers.midwest.net/bbbad50/BBBAD_GT_SIG.gif">    <P><A HREF="http://scribers.midwest.net/bbbad50/V8Fiero" TARGET=_blank>BBBAD V8</A><P><A HREF="http://scribers.midwest.net/bbbad50/Fiero.htm" TARGET=_blank>BBBAD GT</A><P><A HREF="http://scribers.midwest.net/bbbad50/" TARGET=_blank>BBBAD 5.0</A>||||reg||1
