Z||000017||HugGRRRFiero||09-14-2000||12:00 PM||||Those wheels on the yellow Fiero look like Konig Monsoon's to me at first glance but looks like they are Konig Reigns.  They have a similar look, but without all those screws around the rim.  I'd suggest the Reigns out of the two because it looks like it would be a better wheel to clean and maintain.<P>You can order those from Discount Tire.  <A HREF="http://www.discounttire.com" TARGET=_blank>www.DiscountTire.com</A> or from a local store.<P>Konig Monsoon<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.discounttiredirect.com/image/wheel/konmon.large.jpg">    <P>Konig Reign<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.discounttiredirect.com/image/wheel/konrei.large.jpg">   <P>Here's the page for the Reign wheel:<BR><A HREF="http://www.discounttire.com/mega-bin/megajen?tem=san.wheelBrandChart.tem&wheel.value=KONREI&header.value=Cars/Minivans" TARGET=_blank>Konig Reign</A><P>------------------<BR>          <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/huggrrr.gif">        <BR>        <A HREF="mailto:HugGRRRFiero@hotmail.com">HugGRRRFiero@hotmail.com</A> <p>[This message has been edited by HugGRRRFiero (edited 09-14-2000).]||||reg||1
